msgid "Pending change"
msgstr "待上传的更改"

msgid "Pending uploads discarded."
msgstr "已丢弃待上传内容。"

msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "百分比"

msgid "Post"
msgstr "发布"

msgid "Post %1 highlights and notes from “%2” to NeoDB?\n\nEach one becomes a separate note, and they cannot be taken back from here."
msgstr "将《%2》中的 %1 条高亮和笔记发布到 NeoDB？\n\n每条内容都会成为一篇独立笔记，无法在此撤回。"

msgid "Post anyway"
msgstr "仍然发布"

msgid "Post highlights to NeoDB whenever you export them?\n\nEach highlight NeoDB has not already been told about becomes a separate note on your account, at your default visibility, and cannot be taken back from here.\n\nOnly books linked to a NeoDB entry are touched, whether or not their own upload switch is on."
msgstr "每次导出高亮时，都将其发布到 NeoDB？\n\n尚未分享到 NeoDB 的每条高亮都会成为你账号上的一篇独立笔记，使用默认可见范围，且无法在此撤回。\n\n仅处理已关联到 NeoDB 条目的书籍，不受各书籍的自动上传开关影响。"

msgid "Post something…"
msgstr "发布动态…"

msgid "Post them"
msgstr "发布全部"

msgid "Post to NeoDB"
msgstr "发布到 NeoDB"

msgid "Post: %1"
msgstr "动态：%1"

msgid "Posted to NeoDB."
msgstr "已发布到 NeoDB。"

msgid "Posting note…"
msgstr "正在发布笔记…"

msgid "Posting…"
msgstr "正在发布…"

msgid "Posts every highlight and note NeoDB has not already been told about, each as its own note on that book's linked NeoDB entry.\n\nOnly books linked to a NeoDB entry are touched, whether or not their own \"Upload new highlights and notes\" switch is on. Books that are not linked are skipped."
msgstr "上传所有尚未分享到 NeoDB 的高亮和笔记，每条内容都会成为对应书籍条目下的一篇独立笔记。\n\n仅处理已关联到 NeoDB 条目的书籍，不受各书籍“上传新增高亮和笔记”开关影响。未关联的书籍将被跳过。"

msgid "Posts every highlight and note in this book that NeoDB has not been told about, however long ago you made it. Works whether the per-book switch under “Settings for this book” is on or not."
msgstr "上传本书中所有尚未分享到 NeoDB 的高亮和笔记，无论创建于何时。“本书设置”中的自动上传开关不影响此操作。"

msgid "Posts every highlight and note you make in this book from now on to NeoDB, quietly and without asking: the passage, whatever you wrote about it, and where in the book it is. What the book already holds is left alone."
msgstr "从现在起，自动将本书中新增的高亮和笔记分享到 NeoDB，包括引文、你写的笔记和阅读位置。过程静默，无需确认；已有的高亮和笔记不受影响。"

msgid "Prefixes shared highlights with \"> \" so they read as a quotation."
msgstr "在分享的高亮文字前加上“> ”，使其显示为引用块。"

msgid "Private"
msgstr "私密"

msgid "Progress for “%1”"
msgstr "《%1》的阅读进度"

msgid "Progress goes out every hour while you read, and when the book is closed, whenever the position moved. It is queued quietly; nothing turns on Wi-Fi."
msgstr "阅读时每小时，以及关闭书籍时，如阅读位置发生变化，便更新进度。上传会静默排队，不会自动打开 Wi-Fi。"

msgid "Progress sent: %1"
