msgid "Sends where you are in this book to NeoDB every hour while you read, and when the book is closed — whenever the position moved. Queued quietly; nothing turns on Wi-Fi."
msgstr "阅读时每小时，以及关闭本书时，如阅读位置发生变化，便向 NeoDB 更新进度。上传会静默排队，不会自动打开 Wi-Fi。"

