msgstr "登录 %1\n\n请选择登录方式。"

msgid "Sign in to NeoDB\n\nHow would you like to do it?"
msgstr "登录 NeoDB\n\n请选择登录方式。"

msgid "Sign in to NeoDB first, under Tools → NeoDB."
msgstr "请先在“工具 → NeoDB”中登录。"

msgid "Sign in to NeoDB…"
msgstr "登录 NeoDB…"

msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "退出登录"

msgid "Sign out of NeoDB?"
msgstr "退出 NeoDB 登录？"

msgid "Sign out of NeoDB?\n\n%1 pending upload(s) will be discarded."
msgstr "退出 NeoDB 登录？\n\n将丢弃 %1 项待上传内容。"

msgid "Signed in as %1"
msgstr "已以 %1 的身份登录"

msgid "Signed in to NeoDB as %1."
msgstr "已以 %1 的身份登录 NeoDB。"

msgid "Signed out of NeoDB."
msgstr "已退出 NeoDB 登录。"

msgid "Signing in…"
msgstr "正在登录…"

msgid "Starting sign-in…"
msgstr "正在开始登录…"

msgid "Status on NeoDB: %1"
msgstr "NeoDB 状态：%1"

msgid "Status unknown — never synced"
msgstr "状态未知，尚未同步"

msgid "Status: %1"
msgstr "状态：%1"

msgid "Status: not known yet (never synced)."
msgstr "状态：未知（尚未同步）。"

msgid "Stop asking"
msgstr "不再询问"

msgid "Suggest to link with NeoDB (only once per book)"
msgstr "提示关联 NeoDB（每本书仅一次）"

msgid "Tags: %1"
msgstr "标签：%1"

msgid "That does not look like a server address."
msgstr "这似乎不是有效的服务器地址。"

msgid "That link is a %1, not a book."
msgstr "此链接对应的是 %1，而非书籍。"

msgid "That sign-in hasn't finished yet.\n\nFinish on your phone, then tap Done again."
msgstr "登录尚未完成。\n\n请先在手机上完成登录，再次点击“完成”。"

msgid "The NeoDB server reported an error."
msgstr "NeoDB 服务器返回错误。"

msgid "The NeoDB server sent something unexpected."
msgstr "NeoDB 服务器返回了无法识别的内容。"

msgid "The NeoDB server took too long to answer."
msgstr "NeoDB 服务器响应超时。"

msgid "The note is empty."
msgstr "笔记内容为空。"

msgid "The pairing service did not return a usable sign-in."
msgstr "配对服务未返回有效的登录信息。"

msgid "The post is empty."
msgstr "动态内容为空。"

msgid "These apply to a book that NeoDB does not know yet. The last two set what the link dialog offers, and each book then keeps its own answer, under “Settings for this book”."
msgstr "这些设置适用于尚未关联到 NeoDB 的书籍。后两项决定关联窗口中的默认选项，此后每本书会保留自己的设置，可在“本书设置”中修改。"

msgid "This book has %1 pages."
msgstr "本书共有 %1 页。"

msgid "This book is linked to a different NeoDB instance.\n\nFind it on the one you're signed in to?"
msgstr "本书已关联到其他 NeoDB 实例。\n\n要在当前登录的实例上查找吗？"

msgid "This book is linked to a different NeoDB server. Finding it again links it to the one you are signed in to."
msgstr "本书已关联到另一台 NeoDB 服务器。重新查找可将其关联到当前登录的服务器。"

msgid "This book is not linked to NeoDB yet."
msgstr "本书尚未关联到 NeoDB。"

msgid "This book is not linked to NeoDB."
msgstr "本书未关联到 NeoDB。"

msgid "This book isn't linked"
msgstr "本书尚未关联"

msgid "This book isn't linked to a NeoDB entry yet.\n\nFind it now?"
msgstr "本书尚未关联到 NeoDB 条目。\n\n现在查找吗？"

msgid "This book isn't on a NeoDB shelf yet; saving will mark it as Reading."
msgstr "本书尚未加入 NeoDB 书架；保存后会标记为“在读”。"

msgid "This device has not been told what NeoDB holds for this book.\n\nSaving now would replace any rating and comment you made elsewhere."
msgstr "此设备尚未获取本书在 NeoDB 上的记录。\n\n现在保存会覆盖你在其他地方设置的评分和短评。"

msgid "This post is %1 characters long. Most NeoDB servers accept %2.\n\nPost it anyway?"
msgstr "这条动态有 %1 个字符，大多数 NeoDB 服务器最多接受 %2 个。\n\n仍要发布吗？"

msgid "This sign-in link has expired or was already used.\n\nStart again to get a fresh one."
msgstr "此登录链接已过期或已被使用。\n\n请重新开始以获取新链接。"

msgid "Title, author, or ISBN."
msgstr "书名、作者或 ISBN。"

msgid "Title: %1"
msgstr "标题：%1"

msgid "Title: none"
msgstr "标题：无"

msgid "Too many uploads are already waiting. Upload them first, under Tools → NeoDB → Uploads."
msgstr "待上传内容过多。请先在“工具 → NeoDB → 上传”中完成上传。"

msgid "Translated by %1"
msgstr "译者：%1"

msgid "Type an access token"
msgstr "手动输入访问令牌"

msgid "Type the code NeoDB showed you after you approved access."
msgstr "请输入允许访问后 NeoDB 显示的验证码。"

msgid "Unit: page"
msgstr "单位：页码"

msgid "Unit: percent"
msgstr "单位：百分比"

msgid "Unlink"
msgstr "取消关联"

msgid "Unlink this book from “%1”?\n\nYour NeoDB marks are not touched."
msgstr "取消本书与《%1》的关联？\n\n你的 NeoDB 标记不会受到影响。"

msgid "Unlink this book…"
msgstr "取消本书关联…"

msgid "Unlinked from NeoDB."
msgstr "已取消与 NeoDB 的关联。"

msgid "Unlisted"
msgstr "不公开列出"

msgid "Unlisted posts are not shown in public timelines."
msgstr "不公开列出的动态不会显示在公共时间线上。"

msgid "Untitled"
msgstr "无标题"

msgid "Update progress"
msgstr "更新进度"

msgid "Update progress (%1)"
msgstr "更新进度（%1）"

msgid "Update progress automatically"
msgstr "自动更新阅读进度"

msgid "Update reading progress"
msgstr "更新阅读进度"

msgid "Upload all highlights and notes…"
msgstr "上传全部高亮和笔记…"

msgid "Upload automatically when connected"
msgstr "联网后自动上传"

msgid "Upload highlights"
msgstr "上传高亮"

msgid "Upload new highlights and notes"
msgstr "上传新增高亮和笔记"

msgid "Upload new highlights and notes automatically"
msgstr "自动上传新增高亮和笔记"

msgid "Upload now"
msgstr "立即上传"

msgid "Uploading %1 pending change(s)…"
msgstr "正在上传 %1 项更改…"

msgid "Uploads: %1 could not be sent"
msgstr "上传：%1 项失败"

msgid "Uploads: %1 waiting"
msgstr "上传：%1 项待上传"

msgid "Uploads: %1 waiting, paused"
msgstr "上传：%1 项待上传，已暂停"

msgid "Uploads: all sent"
msgstr "上传：全部完成"

msgid "Use a different instance"
msgstr "使用其他实例"

msgid "Use the token found in\n%1?"
msgstr "使用在以下文件中找到的令牌？\n%1"

msgid "Used by the QR code sign-in, which lets you choose a server and sign in on your phone. It only ever holds one sign-in for a few minutes. Clear it to hide that option."
msgstr "用于二维码登录，让你在手机上选择服务器并登录。每次登录信息只暂存几分钟。清空地址可隐藏此选项。"

msgid "Visibility: %1"
msgstr "可见范围：%1"

msgid "Visible to: %1"
msgstr "可见范围：%1"

msgid "Want to read"
msgstr "想读"

msgid "What do you want to say?"
msgstr "你想说些什么？"

msgid "What is NeoDB"
msgstr "什么是 NeoDB"

msgid "What is NeoDB…"
msgstr "什么是 NeoDB…"

msgid "When you open a book for the first time, this offers to find it on NeoDB. There is no question when you are signed out, or when the book already has a link."
msgstr "首次打开一本书时，提示在 NeoDB 上查找。未登录或书籍已经关联时不会提示。"

msgid "When you reach the last page of a linked book, set its NeoDB status to Finished."
msgstr "读到已关联书籍的最后一页时，将其 NeoDB 状态设为“已读”。"

msgid "Who can see this?"
msgstr "谁可以看见？"

msgid "Writes a post on your NeoDB account, with no book attached to it. Queued like everything else if you are offline."
msgstr "在 NeoDB 账号上发布一条不关联书籍的动态。离线时会加入上传队列。"

msgid "You are not signed in to NeoDB yet."
msgstr "你尚未登录 NeoDB。"

msgid "You will not be asked again. Turn this back on in the NeoDB settings."
msgstr "以后不再询问。可在 NeoDB 设置中重新开启。"

msgid "You're at %1."
msgstr "当前进度为 %1。"

msgid "Your account lives on one instance; pick the one you signed up with."
msgstr "每个账号属于一个实例；请选择你注册账号的实例。"

msgid "Your note"
msgstr "笔记正文"

msgid "Your rating"
msgstr "你的评分"

msgid "automatic"
msgstr "自动"

